1" :answer-field/correct "320495cd-b91e-5ab4-9636-a2cb8d05472b"] [:db/ensure "012e87ce-62e2-5fef-b9d3-81bef70eb041" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f" :question/id #uuid "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f"] [:db/add "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M,$ given by\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}3 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -7 & 5 & 7 & -9 \\\\ 4 & 7 & 8 & -7\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_{1}:=-7R_{1}$ on $M?$"] [:db/add "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f" :question/worked-solution "The operation $R_{1}:=-7R_{1}$ means that we need to multiply the first row of the matrix by $-7.$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row by $-7$, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M &= \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}3 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -7 & 5 & 7 & -9 \\\\ 4 & 7 & 8 & -7\\end{array}\\right]\\,R_{1}:=-7R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-7\\cdot 3 & -7\\cdot (-2) & -7\\cdot 2 & -7\\cdot 1 \\\\ -7 & 5 & 7 & -9 \\\\ 4 & 7 & 8 & -7\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-21 & 14 & -14 & -7 \\\\ -7 & 5 & 7 & -9 \\\\ 4 & 7 & 8 & -7\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f" :question/answer-fields "012e87ce-62e2-5fef-b9d3-81bef70eb041"] [:db/ensure "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059772 :knowledge-point/questions "65dd0e3f-df17-5247-83b5-f5148106ed8f"] [:db/add "312b6c1a-7161-59a4-89cb-0c8610c8fdc7" :answer/id #uuid "312b6c1a-7161-59a4-89cb-0c8610c8fdc7"] [:db/add "312b6c1a-7161-59a4-89cb-0c8610c8fdc7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "312b6c1a-7161-59a4-89cb-0c8610c8fdc7" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -7 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -9 & 2 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 4\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "312b6c1a-7161-59a4-89cb-0c8610c8fd